{"id":3993,"date":"2025-05-28T04:51:54","date_gmt":"2025-05-28T04:51:54","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=3993"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:45:26","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:45:26","slug":"6-buoc-ban-hang-tren-tiktok-shop","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/6-buoc-ban-hang-tren-tiktok-shop\/","title":{"rendered":"6 b\u01b0\u1edbc b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi."},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"E0ZvdRp2SolEn3xkjHdlIsJHgwc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I8uHdgoVYoSly5xKSIyltduKgWd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u1ea1n m\u1edbi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u kinh doanh v\u00e0 mu\u1ed1n t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng TikTok \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3? \u0110\u1eebng b\u1ecf qua 6 b\u01b0\u1edbc c\u1ef1c \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u01b0ng c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 \u201cra \u0111\u01a1n\u201d d\u00e0nh ri\u00eang cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi! D\u00f9 b\u1ea1n b\u00e1n qu\u1ea7n \u00e1o, \u0111\u1ed3 \u0103n hay m\u1ef9 ph\u1ea9m, ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n l\u00e0m \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch, TikTok s\u1ebd l\u00e0 \u201cm\u1ecf v\u00e0ng\u201d gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn h\u00e0ng ng\u00e0n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y. C\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon<\/strong><\/a> kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 ngay v\u00e0 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng k\u00eanh b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u view h\u00f4m nay nh\u00e9!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DZlNd2edVoTt9ex397VlS6NHgAg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-SutVdE4nDoRXt6xS1QBlxZRXgmh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">V\u00ec sao n\u00ean b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UajBdDtTvoZSaKxMUWhlzcIlg6e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 gi\u1edbi tr\u1ebb \u2013 nh\u00f3m kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng mua s\u1eafm online nhi\u1ec1u nh\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n nay. Nh\u1edd v\u00e0o video ng\u1eafn v\u00e0 livestream, b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u01a1n nhanh ngay tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng t\u1ed1n nhi\u1ec1u chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ux8Zd02CAoaFHgx2s3MlNPskgKd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u kinh doanh online v\u1edbi chi ph\u00ed th\u1ea5p, l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn cao. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n ch\u01b0a bi\u1ebft b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb \u0111\u00e2u, <strong>Lemon Digital <\/strong>c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh c\u00f9ng b\u1ea1n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng n\u1ed9i dung, t\u1ed1i \u01b0u c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn tri\u1ec3n khai chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean TikTok Shop n\u00e0o.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3986\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3986\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3986\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/22.png\" alt=\"B\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/22.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/22-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/22-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/22-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/22-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3986\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">B\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"E0ZvdRp2SolEn3xkjHdlIsJHgwc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CidVdpnCSoo2u0xW8PGlU38ngtc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">6 b\u01b0\u1edbc b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-BqJTdsVgHocwJ8x2kp5lhy9Vgeg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n<\/h3>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F8pUdd3yaoWvdBxOKwnlyxdkg6e\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>T\u1ea3i \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng TikTok tr\u00ean App Store ho\u1eb7c Google Play.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZR00dQTJZorQ1nxd9kRlJ2zhgbb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>M\u1edf app v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn <strong>\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pv1xdjnhvo9gdDxmL8elR4yCgNd\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd b\u1eb1ng s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, email ho\u1eb7c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OEmYdjeDconrUyxrKFsl19bWgMc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Nh\u1eadp th\u00f4ng tin v\u00e0 m\u00e3 x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XUf6dNjq9o5I8WxpEELl9sSmgEj\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>T\u1ea1o t\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng v\u00e0 m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ay5idqkDaopuncxgSwSlTtuSgpd\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 v\u1edbi \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 ng\u1eafn.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-DjUsdofljoTc37xqGSSlGpqigie\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok Shop<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H2redBx03oPk72xMaFLl01QRgte\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Truy c\u1eadp trang web \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n. \u0110i\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 th\u00f4ng tin c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft, bao g\u1ed3m t\u00ean c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9, s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i v\u00e0 c\u00e1c gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd x\u00e1c minh n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau c\u1ea7u. Sau khi ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u00f3 quy\u1ec1n truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o giao di\u1ec7n qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd TikTok Shop \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u kinh doanh.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"E0ZvdRp2SolEn3xkjHdlIsJHgwc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I7HcdVlPnoaCxXxI8zkluB08gih\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp trang \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TM20dmPbuop8HZxly1mlvKd3gwh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o link: <a href=\"https:\/\/shop.tiktok.com\/merchant\/vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">shop.tiktok.com\/merchant\/vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AiMMd6FNRoVkVWxgfUplS1ofgke\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: \u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6Lud7zkPoi0s0xrjvElBjTFgUg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp b\u1eb1ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok hi\u1ec7n c\u00f3 ho\u1eb7c t\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n m\u1edbi.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LZIAdYQt3ofsH8xESFwl7HVagth\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Cung c\u1ea5p th\u00f4ng tin c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AHvbduUjioklkvxOYnGlTRlQgKf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nh\u1eadp t\u00ean c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng, lo\u1ea1i h\u00ecnh kinh doanh v\u00e0 c\u00e1c th\u00f4ng tin li\u00ean quan.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TfVcdRG2toBFECxWRnIl9N0hgqg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: X\u00e1c minh danh t\u00ednh<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ErYpdA1VCoSze2xfUdFlqIK8g3O\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C\u00e1 nh\u00e2n:<\/strong> T\u1ea3i l\u00ean \u1ea3nh ch\u1ee5p m\u1eb7t tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 m\u1eb7t sau c\u1ee7a C\u0103n c\u01b0\u1edbc c\u00f4ng d\u00e2n (CCCD) ho\u1eb7c H\u1ed9 chi\u1ebfu.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DEI3dLnc2oiarTxmtX6lDuveg0b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Doanh nghi\u1ec7p:<\/strong> Cung c\u1ea5p gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd kinh doanh v\u00e0 m\u00e3 s\u1ed1 thu\u1ebf c\u1ee7a doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L4h7dfQZzomjblxkL2ClhBJtgrd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: Ch\u1edd x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8EJdazWGoO8HIxxO2rlp086gxh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>TikTok s\u1ebd x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 trong v\u00f2ng 1\u20132 ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ul0bdQNoDoV41ExmWPwlnr47gkE\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Sau khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c duy\u1ec7t, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-CkfXdjykFozDNixorGgl5kDpgnc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">L\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DBqGdZ5vxoOzNcxI7y8lPJUugTu\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc then ch\u1ed1t \u0111\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok. N\u00ean \u01b0u ti\u00ean m\u00f3n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o, \u0111ang hot ho\u1eb7c thi\u1ebft y\u1ebfu, d\u1ec5 b\u00e1n v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 g\u1eedi. Nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i th\u1ee7 k\u1ef9 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1ed1t, t\u0103ng c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng khi b\u00e1n tr\u00ean TikTok Shop.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-EEJQdzMefonffex40eZlsF5TgAe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm v\u00e0 x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X9hPdIRIUoisXpxuWC6l6WoogRW\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm tr\u00ean TikTok nh\u01b0 ID ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng, video, hashtag ho\u1eb7c t\u00ean b\u00e0i h\u00e1t \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng. T\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi s\u1edf th\u00edch c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat s\u1ef1 ch\u00fa \u00fd v\u00e0 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PsvLd8fNDoDMZ7xGDMdl3hEEgUf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea t\u1eeb Feedforce, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u Yody d\u00f9ng hashtag #thoitrang v\u00e0 livestream v\u1edbi influencer \u0111\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3, h\u1ecd thu h\u00fat h\u01a1n 90.000 l\u01b0\u1ee3t theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 t\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1 r\u00f5 r\u1ec7t trong th\u1eddi gian ng\u1eafn.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3985\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3985\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3985\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/21.png\" alt=\"Ngu\u1ed3n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/21.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/21-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/21-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/21-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/21-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3985\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ngu\u1ed3n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"E0ZvdRp2SolEn3xkjHdlIsJHgwc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-SNCad5U3MoCQomxbFawlX5UJgbB\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u0110\u0103ng t\u1ea3i s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SWlXdpyzTobhLsx7fPBlcbU1gab\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sau khi \u0111\u0103ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00ean TikTok Shop, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n t\u1ea1o video qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 th\u1eadt thu h\u00fat. H\u00e3y b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u b\u1eb1ng vi\u1ec7c l\u00ean k\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn, r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn. Ch\u1ecdn ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1eabu ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi concept s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, trang \u0111i\u1ec3m ch\u1ec9n chu \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o thi\u1ec7n c\u1ea3m v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Eki3d5nKzo0FVvxFS4Hlca8Xgtf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi quay, chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, ch\u00e2n \u0111\u1ee1 v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e8n chi\u1ebfu s\u00e1ng. Khi quay, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u1ea1c n\u1ec1n trending ho\u1eb7c ghi \u00e2m gi\u1ecdng th\u1eadt \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n. M\u1ed9t video ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, b\u1eaft trend \u0111\u00fang l\u00fac s\u1ebd gi\u00fap s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u00e0 g\u00e2y \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ea1nh v\u1edbi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-V6vvdoH7GowHJpx8FlHlP4I7gsf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YWFCdH8JLot4Jkxb7aqlkoWUgVd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi c\u00f3 \u0111\u01a1n, h\u00e3y x\u1eed l\u00fd th\u1eadt nhanh \u2013 v\u00ec t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 s\u1ed1ng c\u00f2n! \u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn, giao \u0111\u00fang h\u1eb9n \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0i l\u00f2ng ngay t\u1eeb l\u1ea7n mua \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean. Lu\u00f4n theo d\u00f5i h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 k\u1ecbp h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 n\u1ebfu c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 c\u1ed1. \u0110\u1eebng qu\u00ean tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi tin nh\u1eafn v\u00e0 b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch b\u1eb1ng s\u1ef1 nhi\u1ec7t t\u00ecnh, th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n \u2013 v\u00ec m\u1ed7i cu\u1ed9c tr\u00f2 chuy\u1ec7n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n kh\u00e1ch v\u00e0 bi\u1ebfn h\u1ecd th\u00e0nh &#8220;fan c\u1ee9ng&#8221; c\u1ee7a shop b\u1ea1n! Kh\u00e1ch vui, \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 t\u1ed1t \u2013 \u0111\u01a1n s\u1ebd v\u1ec1 \u0111\u1ec1u!<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3984\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3984\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3984\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/20.png\" alt=\"Ki\u1ec3m tra v\u00e0 \u0111i \u0111\u01a1n cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/20.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/20-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/20-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/20-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/20-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3984\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ki\u1ec3m tra v\u00e0 \u0111i \u0111\u01a1n cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"E0ZvdRp2SolEn3xkjHdlIsJHgwc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UuwWd77g2o1sb9xTZZflNn5wg6e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-A1UTd2YhKoiAnPxa2oCltZoLgdh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">B\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Tiktok Shop c\u00f3 m\u1ea5t ph\u00ed kh\u00f4ng?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OeI2dB1uGoy37RxBs9dlYyRUgcb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ph\u00ed giao d\u1ecbch:<\/strong> 5% tr\u00ean t\u1ed5ng s\u1ed1 ti\u1ec1n kh\u00e1ch thanh to\u00e1n (bao g\u1ed3m ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n) cho \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fu2ddQdaAotqcixatfPlO5Ilg26\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ph\u00ed hoa h\u1ed3ng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng: <\/strong>Nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng th\u01b0\u1eddng: 4% tr\u00ean gi\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m sau chi\u1ebft kh\u1ea5u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BvNkdoXvToyNqXxGcPDll10GgGf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Shop Mall:<\/strong> 6,05% tr\u00ean gi\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m sau chi\u1ebft kh\u1ea5u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PZLxdGORVoZ4ZrxNWJIlRTeZgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n:<\/strong> T\u00ednh theo tr\u1ecdng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ho\u1eb7c k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc g\u00f3i h\u00e0ng, t\u00f9y theo tr\u1ecdng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng n\u00e0o l\u1edbn h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LiN7dsfHbo1PKQxahcXlbvs5grg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ph\u00ed d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Freeship Extra:<\/strong> 4,5% tr\u00ean gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng sau chi\u1ebft kh\u1ea5u n\u1ebfu tham gia ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh Freeship Extra.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HDUPd1GsyoMkz1xeodClbKsTgUe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Thu\u1ebf:<\/strong> 1,5% thu\u1ebf GTGT v\u00e0 thu\u1ebf thu nh\u1eadp c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n n\u1ebfu doanh thu tr\u00ean 100 tri\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed3ng\/n\u0103m.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Akq0dOnGgoh8obxO82clGbUcgFg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>L\u01b0u \u00fd:<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YxLOdk0XQoKe8Ixrq3XlIA5XgSb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed tr\u00ean mang t\u00ednh tham kh\u1ea3o v\u00e0 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00f9y theo ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt t\u1eeb TikTok Shop t\u1eebng th\u1eddi k\u1ef3. Ph\u00ed \u0111\u00e3 bao g\u1ed3m thu\u1ebf GTGT theo quy \u0111\u1ecbnh. N\u1ebfu c\u00f3 m\u00e3 s\u1ed1 thu\u1ebf h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7, TikTok Shop s\u1ebd thu ph\u00ed d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ch\u01b0a bao g\u1ed3m thu\u1ebf.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hhx1dIRnOorCGNxhpFSlhvzagnh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HAOVdFzYUoK4egxxpn4lnKyOgCh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">M\u1ed9t S\u1ed1 L\u01b0u \u00dd Quan Tr\u1ecdng Cho Ng\u01b0\u1eddi M\u1edbi.<\/h2>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UepDdxVJjoYQJIx1HmNlmqKWgYg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb k\u1ef9 c\u00e0ng t\u1eeb kh\u00e2u \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd, l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VOQ9dQPqLoHQuCx9cGAlmk3ZgUc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Lu\u00f4n c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt c\u00e1c xu h\u01b0\u1edbng, hashtag th\u1ecbnh h\u00e0nh tr\u00ean TikTok \u0111\u1ec3 video d\u1ec5 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OXiJdMcbforBFTxY2JFlszAogZg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u00fa tr\u1ecdng ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng video: h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, \u00e2m thanh t\u1ed1t, n\u1ed9i dung h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TD18dgy13oECwixyEokl3ILlgOg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i nhanh ch\u00f3ng, l\u1ecbch s\u1ef1 m\u1ecdi tin nh\u1eafn, b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng l\u00f2ng tin v\u00e0 gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y7XIdX2f8opDR5xN3Z8lEdMyg3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Theo d\u00f5i s\u00e1t sao \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, x\u1eed l\u00fd k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi m\u1ecdi ph\u00e1t sinh \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh g\u00e2y tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m x\u1ea5u cho kh\u00e1ch.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qn27dpMOVofheuxMXySl9fSlghf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u k\u1ef9 v\u1ec1 c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a TikTok Shop \u0111\u1ec3 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd chi ph\u00ed hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gvt7dz5Ndoe826xQ43jl3M5YgVg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\u0110\u1ea7u t\u01b0 th\u1eddi gian h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi, th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m c\u00e1c c\u00e1ch l\u00e0m m\u1edbi \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3987\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3987\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3987\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/23.png\" alt=\"V\u00e0i l\u01b0u \u00fd nh\u1ecf b\u1ecf t\u00fai b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/23.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/23-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/23-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/23-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/23-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3987\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">V\u00e0i l\u01b0u \u00fd nh\u1ecf b\u1ecf t\u00fai b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BOcEdSKlUo7bZXxDgpmlGL77gyd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-GTwDdR2neok3Hgx1rXlllRzugCh\" style=\"text-align: left;\">K\u1ebft lu\u1eadn.<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RnlfdH5btoBwOkxXkISlT5I4gLf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">K\u1ebft th\u00fac h\u00e0nh tr\u00ecnh v\u1edbi 6 b\u01b0\u1edbc b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng c\u1eeda h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a ri\u00eang m\u00ecnh. H\u00e3y ki\u00ean tr\u00ec, s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ng\u1eebng h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi \u0111\u1ec3 thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 t\u0103ng doanh s\u1ed1 m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y. TikTok Shop kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 n\u01a1i b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng trong th\u1eddi \u0111\u1ea1i s\u1ed1. B\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u ngay h\u00f4m nay \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebfn \u0111am m\u00ea th\u00e0nh th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1!<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"E0ZvdRp2SolEn3xkjHdlIsJHgwc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6IbdOSjPoN23Mx6955lp4LegV7\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li><strong><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong><\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UqgHdgJuOoh4q5xRS00lItLDg0e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/d